- Never use harcoded colors, use these CSS variables, defined in global.css instead :

```css
--background
--background-alt
--background-alt-hover
--text
--light
--primary
--primary-hover
```

These color are defined as destructured rgb (for exemple : `--background: 33, 33, 33`)
So you have to use it this way :

```scss
color: rgb(var(--primary))
```

- Root Component Class are using PascalCase. other are using pascalCase

For example : 
```tsx
const Component = () => (<div {...className('Component')}><div {...className('authorName')}></div></div>)
```

# Nesting
Limit nesting to 3 levels maximum to keep specificity manageable
Use BEM-like approach with parent-child relationships
Child elements should be nested inside parent selectors
State classes should be used directly, not nested